i believe there are ony 3 things worth wishing for--
first, a blessed scroll of charging, if you are using a wand of wishing
second, a wand of polymorph.
third, amulet of lifesaving.

with a wand of polymorph, you can make your own luck stones.
you can make your own dragon scale mail.

well, perhaps a stormbringer is also worth wishing for for a non-chaotic
character.

another exception is for a healer/tourist/knight in the beginning of the
game.  one can wish for a wand of fire, find a sink, and instantly (almost)
get to ex. level 30.

things like luckstones and boots of speed and guantlets of power and
speed boots or dragonscale mail are dumb to wish for because a wand of
polymorph will make all of these.


